In the 2025.0717 release the node pointer C is deallocated at line 408 without ever being
associated, so its state is undefined. On arm64 (Apple Silicon under Docker) that aborts with
"free(): invalid pointer" on the first time step. ELMFIRE's main branch initialises it the same way.

diff --git a/build/source/elmfire_level_set.f90 b/build/source/elmfire_level_set.f90
index 5faef14..5d76646 100755
--- a/build/source/elmfire_level_set.f90
+++ b/build/source/elmfire_level_set.f90
@@ -54,7 +54,7 @@ CHARACTER(7) :: SEVEN_ICASE
 CHARACTER(16) :: TIMESTAMP
 CHARACTER(400) :: FN
 
-TYPE(NODE), POINTER :: C, DUMMY_NODE => NULL()
+TYPE(NODE), POINTER :: C => NULL(), DUMMY_NODE => NULL()
 
 TYPE (FUEL_MODEL_TABLE_TYPE) :: FMT
 
